          <li><strong>July 2025:</strong> Grok 4 and Grok 4 Heavy released</li>
          <li><strong>November 2025:</strong> Grok 4.1 launched with improvements</li>
          <li><strong>January 2026:</strong> Grok 3 made free for all users</li>
        </ul>

